-base mb-2\" style=\"color:#E8F5E9\">Honour the Late</h3><p class=\"text-sm\" style=\"color:rgba(232,245,233,0.45)\">Preserve ancestors who have passed — their story lives on</p></div><div class=\"flex-1 max-w-xs p-6 rounded-2xl text-center\" style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07)\"><div class=\"text-4xl mb-3\">🔐</div><h3 class=\"font-display font-semibold text-base mb-2\" style=\"color:#E8F5E9\">Admin Approved</h3><p class=\"text-sm\" style=\"color:rgba(232,245,233,0.45)\">Only verified family members can join — no strangers allowed</p></div></div><style>\n        @keyframes floatLeaf {\n          0%,100% { transform: translateY(0) rotate(0deg); }\n          50%      { transform: translateY(-18px) rotate(8deg); }\n        }\n      </style></div><!--$--><!--/$--><footer class=\"flex justify-center py-3\"><span class=\"text-[10px] text-white/25 tracking-wide\">Powered by Algoplus</span></footer><section aria-label=\"Notifications alt+T\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-relevant=\"additions text\" aria-atomic=\"false\"></section><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-29b8772f425c2b08.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[2971,[\\\"2619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/2619-6352ef9022ea9a44.js\\\",\\\"6718\\\",\\\"static/chunks/6718-ca3879f1a6d53af0.js\\\",\\\"9558\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-f47d7c5d4562707a.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n3:I[9766,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n4:I[8924,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n5:I[8720,[\\\"2619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/2619-6352ef9022ea9a44.js\\\",\\\"6718\\\",\\\"static/chunks/6718-ca3879f1a6d53af0.js\\\",\\\"9558\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-f47d7c5d4562707a.js\\\"],\\\"Toaster\\\"]\\n6:I[1959,[],\\\"ClientPageRoot\\\"]\\n7:I[9547,[\\\"2619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/2619-6352ef9022ea9a44.js\\\",\\\"8974\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/page-9310e2a51e52f429.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\na:I[4431,[],\\\